WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.172
Before a dam,

2
00:00:01.172 --> 00:00:02.392
a mine or a highway

3
00:00:02.392 --> 00:00:03.409
is built,

4
00:00:03.409 --> 00:00:05.294
its effect on the environment

5
00:00:05.294 --> 00:00:06.527
must be assessed.

6
00:00:06.527 --> 00:00:08.246
That's E-I-A.

7
00:00:08.584 --> 00:00:10.566
Category A projects are cleared

8
00:00:10.566 --> 00:00:13.002
by the Union environment ministry.

9
00:00:13.002 --> 00:00:15.393
Category B projects by state-level

10
00:00:15.393 --> 00:00:16.746
authorities.

11
00:00:17.112 --> 00:00:19.310
Screening and scoping decide what

12
00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:20.703
must be studied.

13
00:00:20.703 --> 00:00:22.434
Then public consultation,

14
00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:24.536
and an expert appraisal.

15
00:00:24.886 --> 00:00:27.522
The notification comes under the

16
00:00:27.522 --> 00:00:30.833
Environment Protection Act of 1986,

17
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:32.790
passed after the Bhopal gas

18
00:00:32.790 --> 00:00:33.892
tragedy.

19
00:00:34.586 --> 00:00:35.812
Your turn.

20
00:00:35.812 --> 00:00:37.484
Under which law?
